      "created_at": "2018-03-15T09:33:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-03-15T09:33:18Z",
      "body": "> the tracking protection of Firefox no longer causes that some working bookmarks will be reported as broken! That's why Bookmarks Organizer needs the permission to read and modify the privacy settings and to control the tracking protection setting of Firefox beginning with version 2.0.0. Note: Only one extension can control the tracking protection setting at a time. If another add-on controls this setting, Bookmarks Organizer cannot use this enhancement.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/cadeyrn/bookmarks-organizer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#enhancements\r\n\r\nI will convert this strict permission to an optional permission so that users can opt-in this behaviour.",
      "author_association": "OWNER",
      "pin": null,
