      "created_at": "2018-12-30T18:31:50Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-12-30T18:31:50Z",
      "body": "To clarify the situation: The tracking protection was diabled during the check for broken bookmarks in Bookmarks Organizer 2.0. This change was reverted in Bookmarks Organizer 2.0.1 which was released on the same day due to review feedback. With the next update, Bookmarks Organizer 3.0, this feature will still be disabled. So at the moment there is nothing actionable in this ticket. But the long term plan is still to re-introduce this feature with an opt-in. So leaving this ticket open for this work.",
