      "created_at": "2023-01-08T22:17:28Z",
      "updated_at": "2023-01-08T22:17:28Z",
      "body": "I don't plan to do re-introduce a tracking protection setting for the reason I mentioned a few years ago. Instead I will add a notice that the tracking protection setting can influence the results. That's a duplicate of #109.",
